@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="card">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
        This is a prototype web app for an online AI SAT teacher: it generates lesson scripts,
        explains solutions, and lets students take original practice exams.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        Disclaimer: This app is not affiliated with the College Board. All included practice questions are original.
    </p>

    <h2>AI setup</h2>
    <p>Defaults to Stub mode. OpenAI drives lesson generation; narration audio can use either OpenAI TTS or ElevenLabs.</p>
    <pre><code>Ai__Provider=OpenAI
Ai__OpenAi__ApiKey=YOUR_OPENAI_KEY
Ai__TtsProvider=ElevenLabs
Ai__ElevenLabs__ApiKey=YOUR_ELEVENLABS_KEY
Ai__ElevenLabs__VoiceId=YOUR_ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID</code></pre>

    <h2>“Video” generation</h2>
    <p>
        Videos are implemented as “video jobs” built from scripts. If narration TTS is enabled, the app generates lesson audio
        and synchronizes the whiteboard writing to that narration.
        You can click “Save video” to export a real WebM file.
    </p>
</div>
